  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SQLServerDBOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to Microsoft SQL Server — the industry-leading enterprise relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatars using ADO.NET with indexed lookup columns and full JSON serialisation. Compatible with SQL Server 2016+ and Azure SQL. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- feat: add StellarOASIS, AzureStorageOASIS, SQLServerDBOASIS, OracleDBOASIS providers (a34c5c1)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- feat: fix SQLServerDBOASIS and OracleDBOASIS builds; add MoralisOASIS provider (b4e88b9)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix: replace all stubs in OracleDBOASIS and SQLServerDBOASIS with real ADO.NET implementations (e54be17)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SQLServerDBOASIS",
